 "text": "Solid Waste | Riley County Official Website\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\n-->\nHome\nOur County\nGovernment\nServices\nHow Do I?\nContact Us\nSearch\nRate Schedule\nSolid Waste Management Committee\nCommittee Members\nSolid Waste Management Plan\nHousehold Hazardous Waste\nBattery Recycling\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments\nPublic Works\nSolid Waste\nSolid Waste\nThe Solid Waste Division of Riley County Public Works is in charge of storage and disposal of solid waste in Riley County.\nPolicies & Procedures\nView the standard Policies followed by the Solid Waste Division.\nRates & Fees\nView our Rate Schedule for rates on various types of Solid Waste.\nSolid Waste Management Committee\nThe Solid Waste Management Committee implements the Solid Waste Management Plan and works with other Solid Waste issues.\nRiley County Transfer Station\n1881 Henton Road, Manhattan, KS 66502\nHours\n7:00 a.m - 5:00 p.m Monday - Saturday\nCLOSED Sundays\nPhone\n785-565-6290\nHoliday Closures\nThe Transfer Station will only be closed on the following holidays:\nMemorial Day\nIndependence Day - July 4\nLabor Day\nThanksgiving\nChristmas Eve - December 24 (closed at noon)\nChristmas Day - December 25\nNew Year's Day - January 1\nNote: If any of these holidays fall on a Sunday, the Transfer Station will be closed the following Monday.\nSolid Waste Division\nPhysical Address\n1881 Henton Rd\nManhattan , KS 66502\nPhone: 785-565-6290\nEvan McMillan\nAssistant County Engineer\nCharge Accounts and Credit Card transactions only.\nNo cash or check transactions will be accepted.\nHours 7 a.m - 5 p.m\nMonday - Saturday\nDirectory\nCommission Meetings\nMotor Vehicles\nDistrict Court\nEmployment\nElection Information\nOnline Payment\n-->\nContact Us\nRiley County Offices\n110 Courthouse Plaza\nManhattan, KS 66502\nPhone: 785-565-6200\nFax: 785-537-6394\nSocial Media\nFacebook\nYoutube\nInstagram\nHelpful Links\nATA Bus\nBurn Permits\nCommission Meetings\nDistrict Court\nDriver's Licenses\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nStaff Directory\nTranslate\nSite Map\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
